	<entry>
		<id>https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/h-c-mcneile/the-final-count</id>
		<dc:identifier>https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/h-c-mcneile/the-final-count</dc:identifier>
		<title>The Final Count</title>
		<author>
			<name>H. C. McNeile</name>
			<uri>https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/h-c-mcneile</uri>
			<schema:alternateName>Herman Cyril McNeile</schema:alternateName>
			<schema:sameAs>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/H._C._McNeile</schema:sameAs>
			<schema:sameAs>https://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no96039399.html</schema:sameAs>
		</author>
		<published>2026-09-08T20:43:00Z</published>
		<dc:issued>2026-09-08T20:43:00Z</dc:issued>
		<updated>2026-09-08T20:43:02Z</updated>
		<dc:language>en-GB</dc:language>
		<dc:publisher>Standard Ebooks</dc:publisher>
		<rights>Public domain in the United States. Users located outside of the United States must check their local laws before using this ebook. Original content released to the public domain via the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication.</rights>
		<summary type="text">An arch criminal tries to get his hands on the world’s deadliest poison.</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Chemist Robin Gaunt believes he’s discovered the key to lasting world peace—in the form of the horrific poison gas he’s just perfected. Gaunt is certain that once the British government has the formula, no nation will ever dare start a war, for fear of the consequences. But Gaunt vanishes before can turn over the formula, and people start turning up dead—victims of some unknown poison.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;It doesn’t take long for Bulldog Drummond to be on the case—and it doesn’t take long for him to realize that the man behind the kidnapping and murders is his arch enemy Carl Peterson. This leads to a final confrontation worthy of a Bond movie, as the hero and the evil genius face off in a giant zeppelin loaded with deadly toxin.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
		<category scheme="http://purl.org/dc/terms/LCSH" term="Detective and mystery stories"/>
		<category scheme="http://purl.org/dc/terms/LCSH" term="English fiction--20th century"/>
		<category scheme="http://purl.org/dc/terms/LCSH" term="World War, 1914-1918--Veterans--Fiction"/>
		<category scheme="http://purl.org/dc/terms/LCSH" term="Drummond, Bulldog (Fictitious character)--Fiction"/>
		<category scheme="https://standardebooks.org/vocab/subjects" term="Adventure"/>
		<category scheme="https://standardebooks.org/vocab/subjects" term="Fiction"/>
		<link href="https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/h-c-mcneile/the-final-count/downloads/cover.jpg" rel="http://opds-spec.org/image" type="image/jpeg"/>
